From 4e72e230d0e52c9ef46003aaad6ad477e5a9f7a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 00:02:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/26] Stone evolutions keep learning moves by level-up

tools/hack/evo_moves.py gives the 18 item-evolved species that modern games
leave with only level-1 moves their pre-evolution's later moves, a few levels
later (+max(3, 15%)).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
